My recommendation

Yes, let's design the UI with the voice option from day one, but don't activate the expensive full voice-agent infrastructure yet.

That gives you a 2026-looking product now, while keeping your current Google Cloud cost under control.

And your existing customer app already has the core seven-question feedback workflow, so we can add the voice button without changing the Firestore data model.

The next version I would build is therefore:

Premium UI + animation + microphone input + existing Firestore + existing URL.

Then we can price the full AI Voice Receptionist as a higher plan when we actually sell it.
